  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Equality Directorate Phase 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;llldhetssekretariat fas 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet fokuserar p&#xe5; fortsatt genomf&#xf6;rande av de prioriterade       aktiviteter p&#xe5; tre omr&#xe5;den av den nationella handlingsplanen f&#xf6;r      j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet: 1) representation av kvinnor i det offentliga och       politiska livet, 2) kvinnors ekonomiska egenmakt och 3) kvinnor och   medier. Det syftar ocks&#xe5; till att st&#xe4;rka den serbiska                 J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsdirektoratet,december 2012-december 2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on continued implementation of the priority       activities in three areas of the National Action Plan for Gender      Equality: 1) representation of women in public and political life, 2) women&apos;s economic empowerment and 3) women and media. It also aims to  strengthen the Serbian Gender Equality Directorate. It will take      place during three years, December 2012-December 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
